{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The UnderMind is an atmospheric horror game set in an underground scientific bunker, where every night could be your last. After a catastrophe, terrifying creatures have escaped, and now you are the only hope for survival.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022320/extras/d337b5bad0a4157312c690ef1185f334.avif?t=1772374440\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the last operator, you must:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate the generator \u2013 distribute or shut down power to maintain control of the base.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monitor the doors \u2013 prevent monsters from breaching restricted areas.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain your sanity \u2013 small, twisted creatures are slowly eating away at your mind.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022320/extras/a7e8a719d7a7b598802ce69954a25d5e.avif?t=1772374440\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every decision has consequences. Will you turn on the lights to see the threat, or conserve energy to survive until morning? Save the staff and survive\u2026 until rescue arrives.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022320/extras/8e92f93ef7d0fb9ab97d7d51bd73e5e4.avif?t=1772374440\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022320?t=1772374440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022320/2caf399e20e4004bbcbe22df2a0968fb7e3c9632/pa